    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion, with all events as specified.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward in short bursts, rotate to recover from obstacles, and full_rotate only as last resort. All obstacle states have exactly one recovery action and no forward/random_walk."
